  StyleBox["perm", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "cec0a7b3-2d0d-5a4a-91b5-c367a63e55ab"],
 " can be any permutation of {\"x\",\"y\",\"z\"}. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"793004b3-e802-b046-8f33-d7c2a2ff6f5c"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   ButtonBox["FlipGradientOrientation",
