   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["grad", "TI"], ",", 
    StyleBox["flip", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "42b4be7f-3ed8-8947-9680-648c12a5e790"],
 "\[LineSeparator]flips the internal orientation of the gradients, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["flip", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "c37e75c8-f4a0-6346-970d-275964ac2d9a"],
 " can be {1,1,1}, {-1,1,1}, {1,-1,1} or {1,1,-1}. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"808d6b1d-1062-584e-969c-6c00c0b41358"],
