  "7aa98565-c7e0-3741-b58f-7878161322af"],
 "\[LineSeparator]flips and permutes the internal orientation of the \
gradients. \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"024e5a12-df14-544a-87f3-a603de16f234"],
